#: post-quantum-transport.rst:59
msgid "Verify the negotiated group"
msgstr "验证协商的密钥交换组"

#: post-quantum-transport.rst:62
msgid "We use OpenSSL 3.5 or later to make a fresh connection to the website. Here ``ca.pem`` also trusts the issuer of the public test certificate. Restricting the probe to one group makes the result unambiguous. We check the certificate verification, the negotiated group and the HTTP response."
msgstr "使用 OpenSSL 3.5 或更高版本与网站建立新连接。本例中， ``ca.pem`` 也包含用于信任公网侧测试证书签发者的 CA 证书。探测时只提供一个组，结果就没有歧义。我们检查证书验证结果、协商的组和 HTTP 响应。"

#: post-quantum-transport.rst:64
msgid ""
"printf 'GET /status HTTP/1.1\\r\\nHost: edge.example.test\\r\\nConnection: close\\r\\n\\r\\n' |\n"
"  openssl s_client -connect 127.0.0.1:28443 -servername edge.example.test \\\n"
"    -verify_hostname edge.example.test -CAfile ca.pem -verify_return_error \\\n"
"    -tls1_3 -groups X25519MLKEM768 -alpn http/1.1 -brief -ign_eof"
msgstr ""
"printf 'GET /status HTTP/1.1\\r\\nHost: edge.example.test\\r\\nConnection: close\\r\\n\\r\\n' |\n"
"  openssl s_client -connect 127.0.0.1:28443 -servername edge.example.test \\\n"
"    -verify_hostname edge.example.test -CAfile ca.pem -verify_return_error \\\n"
"    -tls1_3 -groups X25519MLKEM768 -alpn http/1.1 -brief -ign_eof"

#: post-quantum-transport.rst:71
msgid "For RC6, OpenSSL 3.5.7 reported ``Verification: OK`` and ``Negotiated TLS1.3 group: X25519MLKEM768``. We observed the origin separately with an OpenSSL test server restricted first to the hybrid group and then to X25519. Both returned HTTP 200. A mismatched origin certificate name returned 502. The older client example also returned 200 on a hybrid-only origin."
msgstr "测试 RC6 时，OpenSSL 3.5.7 报告 ``Verification: OK`` 和 ``Negotiated TLS1.3 group: X25519MLKEM768`` 。我们也单独检查了源站连接。让 OpenSSL 测试服务器先仅支持混合组，再仅支持 X25519，两次请求都返回 HTTP 200。源站证书名称不匹配时返回 502。旧客户端示例连接只支持混合组的源站时也收到了 200。"

#: post-quantum-transport.rst:73
msgid "We record the date, endpoints, certificate identities, negotiated groups and any plaintext segments for each service. Offering the group permits classical fallback. A policy that requires hybrid-only sessions needs enforcement and evidence on every covered connection. Post-quantum signatures, FIPS 140 module validation and SQLx database TLS each need separate evidence. An edge handshake establishes one item in that inventory."
msgstr "我们逐项记录服务的检查日期、两端地址、证书标识、协商的组，以及传输明文的链路。提供混合组仍允许回退到经典密钥交换。如果策略只允许混合会话，就需要对每一条受约束的连接强制执行并留存证据。抗量子签名、FIPS 140 密码模块验证以及 SQLx 数据库 TLS 连接都需要单独的证据。一次边缘握手只能验证这份清单上的一项。"

